### create (saves the returned code into {{code}})
POST http://localhost:8081/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{"url": "https://github.com/nazbez"}

> {% client.global.set("code", response.body.code); %}

### get
GET http://localhost:8081/api/links/{{code}}

### get missing → 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/links/nope123

### delete
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/links/{{code}}
